    "message": "End a thread job's status, lease and entry together under the API lock\n\nA thread job wrote its final status, recorded telemetry, then released its\nlease and left the job table. A client that saw the status and submitted the\nnext job at once was refused as busy. The three now end together under the\nlock a submit takes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
